    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nDaily Horoscope for May 19, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Pisces, Libra, Cancer and MoreMouni Roy's Cannes 2026 First Look; Actress Stuns in a Fitted Black Mini Dress With White Halter Neckline (View Photos)Nawazuddin Siddiqui Birthday 2026: Five Career-Defining Roles That Made Him a Fan FavouriteHuma Qureshi’s Cannes 2026 Fashion Diary Is All About Boss-Lady Pantsuit, Chic Gown and Stunning Banarasi SareeUrvashi Rautela’s Cannes 2026 Look Draws Gigi Hadid Comparisons; Other Times Her Style Sparked Comparisons With Deepika Padukone and Aishwarya Rai BachchanDiana Penty's Cannes 2026 Wardrobe Is a Masterclass in Elegance and High Fashion, View PhotosWeekly Horoscope Predictions (May 18-24, 2026): Astrology Forecast for All 12 Zodiac Signs This WeekDaily Horoscope for May 18, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Leo, Aquarius, Scorpio and MoreHoroscope Predictions for May 17, 2026: What Sunday’s Horoscope Reveals for Gemini, Taurus, Libra and MoreHoroscope Predictions for May 16, 2026: What Saturday’s Horoscope Reveals for Aries, Pisces, Virgo, Leo and MoreHoroscope Predictions for May 15, 2026: What Friday's Horoscope Reveals for Virgo, Capricorn, Cancer, Pisces and MoreBTS News Today (May 18, 2026): Guinness World Records Names BTS Global ‘Icons’ As First Asian and Only Music Group To Make HistoryIconic Dialogues From ‘The Devil Wears Prada’ and ‘The Devil Wears Prada 2’: Best Lines That Still Feel Sharp And TimelessHuma Qureshi At Cannes 2026: From Sharp Power Dressing To Traditional Saree Glam, Actor Impresses With Versatile LooksAditi Rao Hydari Cannes 2026 Looks: Actor Turns Heads In Regal Champagne Saree And Bold Neon Green Couture Gown\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nBollywood\nMadhuri Dixit Birthday: 5 Films That Made Her the Queen of Bollywood Romance and Drama\nMadhuri Dixit Birthday: 5 Films That Made Her the Queen of Bollywood Romance and Drama\nOn Madhuri Dixit’s 59th birthday, revisit five iconic roles from films like 'Devdas', 'Dil To Pagal Hai' and 'Tezaab' that showcase her timeless charm, grace and Bollywood superstardom.\nTeam BTMay 15, 2026, 07:00 IST\n\n​Madhuri Dixit celebrates her 59th birthday this year on May 15th. Known as Bollywood’s Dhak Dhak girl, she carved a niche for herself and became an overnight sensation. With so many incredible roles and projects under her name, Madhuri continued to reign supreme in the Hindi film industry. She was a name on every director’s wish list and enjoyed a long run as B-town’s numero uno heroine. To celebrate the actress on her special day, here’s looking back at five of her most iconic roles.\n\nSaajan (1991)\n\nIn Saajan, Madhuri Dixit played Pooja, a warm-hearted and romantic young woman caught in an emotional love triangle. Her character falls in love with a poet through his writings, unaware of his true identity. Madhuri brought charm, grace, and emotional depth to the role, making Pooja one of the most memorable characters from the film.\n\nTezaab (1988)\n\nMadhuri Dixit played Mohini, a young woman facing troubled family circumstances. The role became a turning point in her career, especially after the massive success of the song Ek Do Teen, which turned her into an overnight sensation.\n\nDil To Pagal Hai (1997)\n\nIn the movie, she plays a graceful and passionate dancer who believes in the idea of true love and soulmates. Her character brings warmth to the romantic drama as she finds herself caught between friendship, destiny, and love. Madhuri’s chemistry with Shah Rukh Khan, along with her elegant dance performances and screen presence, made this one of the most iconic roles of her career.\n\nDil (1990)\n\nIn the movie, she played a spirited and independent young woman who falls in love despite constant clashes and family opposition. Her lively performance brought charm, emotion and energy to the romantic drama, making the character instantly relatable to audiences.\n\nDevdas (2002)\n\nIn Devdas, Madhuri Dixit portrayed Chandramukhi, a kind-hearted courtesan who brings warmth and compassion into Devdas’ troubled life. While the film is filled with grandeur and heartbreak, Chandramukhi stands out for her quiet strength and selfless love. Madhuri added elegance and emotional richness to the role, especially through the film’s iconic dance performances and deeply moving moments.\n\nHappy Birthday, Madhuri Dixit!\n\nTRENDING\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 19, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Pisces, Libra, Cancer and More\n\nMouni Roy's Cannes 2026 First Look; Actress Stuns in a Fitted Black Mini Dress With White Halter Neckline (View Photos)\n\nNawazuddin Siddiqui Birthday 2026: Five Career-Defining Roles That Made Him a Fan Favourite\n\nHuma Qureshi’s Cannes 2026 Fashion Diary Is All About Boss-Lady Pantsuit, Chic Gown and Stunning Banarasi Saree\n\nUrvashi Rautela’s Cannes 2026 Look Draws Gigi Hadid Comparisons; Other Times Her Style Sparked Comparisons With Deepika Padukone and Aishwarya Rai Bachchan\n\nDiana Penty's Cannes 2026 Wardrobe Is a Masterclass in Elegance and High Fashion, View Photos\n\nWeekly Horoscope Predictions (May 18-24, 2026): Astrology Forecast for All 12 Zodiac Signs This Week\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 18, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Leo, Aquarius, Scorpio and More\n\nHoroscope Predictions for May 17, 2026: What Sunday’s Horoscope Reveals for Gemini, Taurus, Libra and More\n\nHoroscope Predictions for May 16, 2026: What Saturday’s Horoscope Reveals for Aries, Pisces, Virgo, Leo and More\n\nHoroscope Predictions for May 15, 2026: What Friday's Horoscope Reveals for Virgo, Capricorn, Cancer, Pisces and More\n\nBTS News Today (May 18, 2026): Guinness World Records Names BTS Global ‘Icons’ As First Asian and Only Music Group To Make History\n\nIconic Dialogues From ‘The Devil Wears Prada’ and ‘The Devil Wears Prada 2’: Best Lines That Still Feel Sharp And Timeless\n\nHuma Qureshi At Cannes 2026: From Sharp Power Dressing To Traditional Saree Glam, Actor Impresses With Versatile Looks\n\nAditi Rao Hydari Cannes 2026 Looks: Actor Turns Heads In Regal Champagne Saree And Bold Neon Green Couture Gown\n\nRelated Articles\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n‘Main Vaapas Aaunga’ Release Date Announced: Diljit Dosanjh, Vedang Raina And Sharvari Bring Imtiaz Ali’s Love Story To The Big Screen\nTerms of use Privacy Policy\nCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved."
